Is 17p5-0add-15deg-60s-run2 (E=696, PF=0.26) dominated?
- 17p5-0add-16deg-75s has E=697>696 AND PF=0.32>0.26. → **Dominated**

Is 17p5-0add-20deg-run5 (E=530, PF=0.34) dominated?
- 17p5-0add-15deg-60s has E=520<530 but PF=0.36>0.34. Neither dominates the other. Is there E≥530 AND PF≥0.34? 17p5-0add-16deg has E=697>530 but PF=0.32<0.34. 17p5-0add-19deg-90s has E=861 but PF=0.28<0.34. → **Non-dominated**

